     {
      "end": 492,
      "start": 0,
      "text": "Homer Hickam\nHomer Hadley Hickam , Jr. ( born February 19 , 1943 ) is an American author , Vietnam veteran , and a former NASA engineer . His memoir Rocket Boys was a New York Times Best Seller and is studied in many American and international school systems , and was the basis for the 1999 film October Sky . Hickam has also written a number of best-selling memoirs and novels including the `` Josh Thurlow '' historical fiction novels . His books have been translated into many languages ."
     }
